mechanisms.what:
A second PerspectiveCamera rendered in a useFrame with priority 1, using gl.setScissorTest, setViewport and setScissor into a rounded inset about 28% of the width at the bottom-right (or drei <View>). Show a name label and '同時' (meanwhile).

Use it for:
- a P3+ event that overlaps the main shot and is more than 25 m away;
- the far end of a phone call, instead of cross-cutting;
- a second thinker during a stall.
At most one inset at a time. Fade in and out over 0.25 s. It lasts as long as its event, and its own shot rules mirror the main ones (CLOSE or MEDIUM).
